    kg:textSpan "areas, such as solving NLP problems in non-mainstream languages. 1. Introduction Several recent works propose more cost-efficient distributed training strategies that leverage fleets of temporary preemptible instances that can be dynamically allocated in regions with low demand for hardware and electricity, making them 210 times cheaper than their dedicated counterparts ( Harlap et al. , 2017 ). Another solution is to train in collaborations by pooling together preexisting resources or using the" .

