    kg:textSpan "reduce-scatter operation commences after its backward pass. This results in a challenge where the first all-gather operation and the last reduce-scatter operation cannot be hidden. Inspired by PyTorch FSDP [ 15 ], the initial all-gather operation is pre-fetched at the beginning of each iteration, allowing it to overlap with data loading operations, effectively reducing the communication time by a factor of 1 / ( 2 vpp _ size ) . We also launch the high priority communication first to maximize ov" .

