    kg:textSpan "We first apply two algorithmic techniques, parallel transformer block and sliding window attention, to Megatron-LM, achieving 5.6% MFU improvement. Communication is the major bottleneck of large-scale LLM training, and the 3D parallel communication overlapping of MegaScale hides the overhead and accelerates training by 6.2% MFU. We further adopt efficient operators and obtain 1.7% acceleration. Other optimizations such as data pipeline optimizations and the problematic code elimination mentioned" .

