    kg:textSpan "GRAWA (LGRAWA). By design, both of these variants address the curse of symmetry problem (Teng et al., 2019) which occurs when the model is stuck on the hill in the optimization landscape lying in-between workers that are trapped in the local minima around it, and Training deep learning models in a distributed setting has become a necessity in scenarios involving large models and data sets due to efficiency and practicality. There are different ways of parallelizing Proceedings of the 27 th Inter" .

