    kg:textSpan "illustrated in Figure 6. Our engine can be enabled in the configuration file which is supplied to the DeepSpeed engine at runtime and consists of a single attribute object specifying the size of the host buffer which can be reserved per process for caching checkpoints. Note that this extension does not utilize anything specific to DeepSpeed and can be easily adopted by other training runtimes as well. not create contention on the PCIe interface. The checkpoints are flushed to persistent storage," .

