    kg:textSpan "SimpleFSDP: Simpler Fully Sharded Data Parallel with torch.compile Ruisi Zhang 1 , , , Tianyu Liu 2 , , Will Feng 2 , Andrew Gu 2 , Sanket Purandare 3 , , Wanchao Liang 2 , Francisco Massa 2 1 UC San Diego, 2 Meta, 3 Harvard University Equal contribution , Work done at Meta Distributed training of large models consumes enormous computation resources and requires substantial engineering efforts to compose various training techniques. This paper presents SimpleFSDP, a PyTorch-native compiler-based" .

