    kg:textSpan "Echo: Simulating Distributed Training At Scale Yicheng Feng 1 Yuetao Chen 1 Kaiwen Chen 1 Jingzong Li 2 Tianyuan Wu 3 Peng Cheng 4 Chuan Wu 5 Wei Wang 3 Tsung-Yi Ho 1 Hong Xu 1 1 The Chinese University of Hong Kong 2 The Hang Seng University of Hong Kong 3 HKUST 4 Microsoft Research 5 The University of Hong Kong arXiv:2412.12487v1 [cs.LG] 17 Dec 2024 Abstract allelism strategies, optimization techniques, and hardware configurations that are available in the current cluster, to derive the optimal" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2412_12487_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
