    kg:textSpan "the training process (on a given device). In large-scale 3D parallelism training, each GPU device (rank) independently initializes its assigned submodel based on TP and PP, resulting in unique workloads per rank. These workloads are established only when the training framework begins execution. Thus for accuracy, one naturally adopts a runtime tracingbased approach to capture the training workloads [ 19 , 30 , 31 , 49 ]: the per-device execution graph is extracted after each device builds its ex" .

