    kg:textSpan "an internal simulator for throughput estimation across different parallelization strategies. Other simulators such as ASTRA-sim [ 44 ] and SimAI [ 11 ] are also open source, but they have critical limitations. ASTRAsim only supports matrix multiplication kernels; and SimAIs current open-source version (commit ID:44a468c as of Dec. 2024) [ 10 ] does not support pipeline parallelism. 8 Evaluation This section evaluates Echo on vision and language models using two clusters up to 96 GPUs. We describ" .

