    kg:textSpan "comparing it against NCCL-Predictor [ 9 ], the underlying communication model used by both Proteus and FlexFlow. NCCL-Predictor leverages parameters tuned from production experience and employs an model ( 2.3 ). Simulation accuracy. Figures 9 and 10 illustrate the prediction accuracy for intraand inter-server collective communication under varying message sizes (4MB to 256MB) and cluster scales. Across most cases, Echo consistently outperforms NCCL-Predictor. In the intra-server setting, Echo ac" .

