    kg:textSpan "[ 27 ] focus on instruction-level modeling, while other approaches [ 19 , 30 , 31 , 49 ] rely on profiling or tracing to capture accurate operator execution times. Echo similarly adopts a trace-based methodology, but crucially does so without requiring a full-scale deployment. Communication simulation. Discrete event simulators like ns-3 [ 36 ] and OMNeT++ [ 41 ] are well-known to have high overheads due to their packet-level whole-stack simulation. Other than parallelization optimizations [ 12 " .

