    kg:textSpan "cost for the rest of the layers and subsequently estimate k . With sequence length ( s ), hidden size ( h ), PCI-E duplex bandwidth ( B o ) and GPU compute bandwidth ( B c ), k is computed as: ( Narayanan et al. , 2021 ; Korthikanti et al. , 2023 ) 1. Introduction As modern large transformer models ( Vaswani et al. , 2017 ) scale towards trillions of parameters, model parallelism becomes essential for distributing model parameters across multiple devices. Compared to ZeRO ( Rajbhandari et al. , " .

