    kg:textSpan "S CALING UP D ATA P ARALLELISM IN D ECENTRALIZED D EEP L EARNING Bing Xie * 1 Junqi Yin * 2 Zhenyu Zhou * 3 Sarp Oral 2 Feiyi Wang 2 A BSTRACT Although it has been extensively explored in theory, decentralized learning is not yet green-lighted for production use, largely due to a lack of stability, scalability, and generality in large scale DNN training. To shed light on the production use of decentralized learning, this work studies decentralized data parallel training at scale. To this end, we" .

