    kg:textSpan "as PyTorch-FSDP [73] and DeepSpeed [52, 55]. While showing promising results, existing offloading solutions are based on one key assumption: the GPU is an accelerator connected to the CPU via PCIe, which has limited communication bandwidth (e.g., 32GB/s for PCIe-Gen4). Due to this bandwidth limitation, prior work primarily focuses on optimizing data transfers between GPU and CPU to avoid PCIe becoming a major performance bottleneck [ 48 , 52 , 55 ]. However, hardware vendors have embarked on the" .

