    kg:textSpan "efficiency. Casting ( 4.5) GraceAdam ( 4.6) Move Cast be trained with a single GPU. Given the drastic change in Superchip architecture and emerging post-training scenarios like long-context extension, an important question arises: shall we offload the FP16 weights from Hopper GPU to the Grace CPU to scale up model training on Superchip? To analyze the theoretical viability of offloading FP16 weights to Grace CPU on Superchip, we use the peak computational throughput ( ), data movement bandwidth " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2509_21271_rag__chunk_009> a kg:Chunk ;
