    kg:textSpan "can get significantly more complex when using other parallelization strategies such as Pipeline Parallelism. In this scenario, the pipeline schedule determines which micro batches are operating on a given GPU at any point, and governs the resulting communication dependencies around them. To model this, we codify the dependencies in a DAG, and then run Monte Carlo simulations to sample each individual probability and quantify the resulting distribution. To model advanced hierarchical parallelizat" .

