    kg:textSpan "not only depends on the fact that there is a slow node, but also where it falls in the pipeline. We demonstrate each rank in the training example, highlighting the GPUs set at the p95 distribution in order to observe its placement in terms of parallelization groups. Note with our parallelization configuration mentioned above, 8 ranks constitute one node, which is assigned to a pipeline stage. As shown, we observe that some stage placements of the degraded node lead to significantly worse perform" .

