    kg:textSpan "of a training iteration. As the number of devices increases, parameter synchronization soon takes up a significant portion of the iteration time. In summary, the data parallel style of diffusion model training limits the training batch size and imposes high synchronization overhead. columns: col1 row: col1=2.4 Efficient pipeline bubble filling with non-trainable components We profile the iteration training time of two popular diffu- sion models (without self-conditioning) by pipelining their bac" .

