    kg:textSpan "model parameters. Inspired by DGC ( Lin et al. , 2018 ), we perform the gradient correction operations, shown in Algorithm 2 , before selecting the indices of top- k gradients. Gradient correction here is the same as the operations performed within the AdamW optimizer ( Loshchilov & Hutter , 2019 ), one of the most commonly used optimizers for training LLMs. Performing the top- k selection on the corrected gradients gives a more accurate selection of the indices with major model parameter change" .

