    kg:textSpan "al., 2019; 2020; Wang & Joshi, 2021), which maintains the communication volume per iteration but lessens the frequency of communication events. 3) Communication and Computation Overlapping aims to overlap communication with computation, Corresponding author. 1 either in a single step or across multiple steps. For instance, the distributed module in PyTorch (Li et al., 2020) leverages gradient bucketing to partially overlap gradient all-reducing with the backward pass. Additionally, asynchronous " .

