    kg:textSpan "5). We explore two communication optimization techniques and integrate them into the program synthesis, to optimize communication on heterogeneous clusters jointly with SPMD sharding. The first optimization involves the trade-off between two All-Gather implementations on heterogeneous clusters and the second is to automatically apply sufficient factor broadcasting [ 51 ] that reduces the communication volume for certain operators (Sec. 4.4). We implement HAP on PyTorch and evaluate it on a 64- G" .

