    :hasEvidenceText "16 heterogenous workers"^^xsd:string,
        "Each worker performs H local gradient descent steps on its assigned data"^^xsd:string,
        "In a parallel computing environment with M workers ( x 1 , x 2 , ..., x M )"^^xsd:string,
        "The partitioned state is assigned to the workers"^^xsd:string,
        "distributing it across workers, each with multiple GPUs."^^xsd:string,
        "each worker transits to a steady state where they alternately execute one forward pass and one backward pass"^^xsd:string,
        "n is the number of workers"^^xsd:string,
        "there is a change in the number of workers assigned to task t i"^^xsd:string ;
