    kg:textSpan "on a variety of model scales ranging from 7B to 175B parameters. We equip prevalent parallel computation paradigms with FP8 supports, including tensor, pipeline, and sequence parallelisms, enabling the utilization of FP8 to train large foundation models. We open-source the first FP8 GPT training codebase based upon Megatron-LM ( Shoeybi et al. , 2019 ) implementation. We expect the release of our FP8 framework will establish a new paradigm for next-generation low-precision training system dedica" .

