    kg:textSpan "largest AI cluster has over 10,000 GPUs. In terms of training efficiency, MegaScale achieves 55.2% MFU when training a standard 175B transformer model on 12,288 GPUs, providing an improvement of 1.34 compared to the state-of-the-art open-source training framework Megatron-LM [ 10 ]. In terms of model converge and stability, we show a real production run of MegaScale that trains a proprietary model with hundreds of billions of parameters on multi-trillion tokens for several weeks. Over the weeks," .

