    kg:textSpan "recent model parameters from workers in other data parallel ranks during the forward pass. The other is the reduce-scatter operation, which collect the gradients in the backward pass. 4 Asynchronous data preprocessing. Data preprocessing is not on the critical path. As a result, while the GPU workers are synchronizing gradients at the end of each training step, the data preprocessing for the subsequent step can start, which hides the preprocessing overhead. stage i FWD FWD S/R S/R FWD BWD S/R S/" .

