    kg:textSpan "is required to have 2 to 4 million tokens, otherwise, the model performance may be degraded, i.e., the longer the sequence length is, the smaller the batch size is. Due to this, several GPUs may need to process one example together. For example, using 2048 GPUs to train 128-layer GPT-3, the sequence length is 4096, the batch size is 1024, data parallelism is 16, pipeline parallelism is 32, and tensor parallelism is 4. In this scenario, the optimal setup is to divide a batch into 64 micro-batches" .

