    kg:textSpan "cloud providers need migrate tenant jobs to improve cluster utilization and other purposes [ 56 , 64 , 75 ]. Since these jobs operate as black boxes to the providers [ 56 ], migration can only be performed at the OS level. For efficiency, serverless platforms need to launch GPU processes quickly [ 16 ]. These processes contain PyTorch runtime states (e.g., compiler cache) that are tightly intertwined with OS information. Rebuilding these states from scratch takes seconds; thankfully, OS-level C/" .

