    kg:textSpan "created on demand for each request [ 16 , 34 ]. Since each process has an entry function to react to a request, we take a checkpoint right before the entry, so once a request comes, we can restore the process from the checkpoint using our concurrent restore protocol described in 6 to avoid the cold start costs [ 5 , 73 ] before entry. Evaluated applications. We focus on evaluating AI applicationsthe dominant GPU applications to show the effectiveness of P H OS. Table 2 summarizes the evaluated a" .

