    kg:textSpan "HETHUB: A DISTRIBUTED TRAINING SYSTEM WITH HETEROGENEOUS CLUSTER FOR LARGE SCALE MODELS Si Xu 1 * Zixiao Huang 2 1 * Yan Zeng 3 1 * Shengen Yan 1 Xuefei Ning 2 Quanlu Zhang 1 Haolin Ye 1 Sipei Gu 1 Chunsheng Shui 1 Zhezheng Lin 1 Hao Zhang 4 Sheng Wang 4 Guohao Dai 5 1 + Yu Wang 2 A BSTRACT Training large-scale models relies on a vast number of computing resources. For example, training the GPT-4 model (1.8 trillion parameters) requires 25000 A100 GPUs . It is a challenge to build a large-scale " .

