    kg:textSpan "provisioning additional resources on-the-fly. This automation and flexibility make serverless computing a powerful tool for accelerating the development and deployment of LLMs, reducing both technical and operational complexities. B. Heterogeneous training Heterogeneous computing involves using a combination of different types of processors and accelerators within a single system to perform computational tasks. In the context of training LLMs, this approach allows each GPU type to handle tasks t" .

