    kg:textSpan "S YNTHESIZING O PTIMAL P ARALLELISM P LACEMENT AND R EDUCTION S TRATEGIES ON H IERARCHICAL S YSTEMS FOR D EEP L EARNING Ningning Xie 1 Tamara Norman 2 Dominik Grewe 2 Dimitrios Vytiniotis 2 A BSTRACT We present a novel characterization of the mapping of multiple parallelism forms (e.g. data and model parallelism) onto hierarchical accelerator systems that is hierarchy-aware and greatly reduces the space of software-to-hardware mapping. We experimentally verify the substantial effect of these map" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2301_06813_rag__chunk_007> a kg:Chunk ;
