    kg:textSpan "the impact of selective overlap occurs with a sequence length of 8k, where the absence of this approach results in an OOM error. This We conduct an evaluation of the largest sequence length for all three systems, configuring both b and n to 1 to facilitate the handling of longer sequences. To ensure compatibility with sequence parallelism ( s sp ), it is crucial that the number of attention heads is divisible by s sp . Additionally, we set 12 Next Step Gradient Accumulation Optimzier Step PS = 4" .

