    kg:textSpan "lightweight tests, including intra-network host and NCCL tests, to diagnose a wide spectrum of potential failures. Vela [ 378 ] employs a two-tiered strategy with lightweight tests running periodically on every node and more intrusive tests executed only when nodes are idle. Googles TPUv4 supercomputer implements a preflight check [ 376 ] before user jobs, consisting of an end-to-end check and an intent-driven checker for hardware health. SuperBench [ 381 ] resents a comprehensive benchmark suit" .

