    kg:textSpan "we design an infinity collective communication library(ICCL) based on Gloo ( Facebook , 2023 ) to support the communication between heterogeneous GPU-accelerators. It includes a CPU-based communicator with Ethernet or IPoIB ( Kashyap , 2006 ) and a GPU-based communicator with IB. At the communication level, we propose a distributed performance predictor to predict the training performance of large-scale models, and an automatic parallel planner to search for efficient distributed training strate" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2407_20018_rag__chunk_008> a kg:Chunk ;
