    kg:textSpan "(double the number of GPUs) with the overall minibatch size fixed (at 4 microbatches) leads to shorter per-minibatch execution time but also a larger fraction of GPU time lost to pipeline bubbles. Pipeline parallelism. To further scale training across multiple computing nodes without introducing large communication overhead of tensor parallelism, the pipeline parallelism solution is used ( Narayanan et al. , 2021 ). Pipeline parallelism partitions the DNN model across its layers. Each partition " .

