    kg:textSpan "pick up a part of values in the gradients or model parameters to communication. Figure 6 shows the Top-K sparsification of a vector, which is a widely used method in data parallel distributed training [ 61 , 62 ]. 7 Experimental Studies 5.2 Adaptive Communication Compression Although communication compression can uniformly reduce the communication time between each node, the model convergence might be affected. To strike a better trade-off between training convergence and communication time, a b" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2410_19367_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
