    kg:textSpan "] , and O [ i ] represent whether to employ activation checkpointing, 3.1. Computation and Memory Profiler To guide the exploration of heterogeneous training strategies, we first need to collect the execution time and memory foot- 3 Profiler Priority-based Scheduler Runtime Solver LLM Structure Cost Model min execution time s.t. memory constraint operator cost Figure 1. The overview of AutoHete. c, p, o { 0 , ..., L } , which represent the number of sequential transformer blocks for applying act" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2504_12471_rag__chunk_001> a kg:Chunk ;
