    kg:textSpan "have the same bubble overhead and weights memory consumption ( M ). The activations memory consumption ( M a ) of the 1F1B schedule exhibits better efficiency but existing imbalance. batches and divides a model into stages within a pipeline, allowing simultaneous execution of different micro-batches across multiple devices. Pipeline parallelism can be categorized into synchronous and asynchronous schemes based on weight update semantic. Synchronous approaches flush periodically at the end of eac" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2505_12242_rag__chunk_012> a kg:Chunk ;
